[606.331325, "o", "## 4. Reconciliation of Change Ticket CHG-1481\r\n\u001b[?2004l\rh\u001b[?2004h"]
[606.331518, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> The draft change ticket `/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:1-25` was based solely on alerts. Reconciliation against disk evidence:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.331755, "o", "1. **Row 1 (Source IP):** Corrected IP from `203.0.113.9` to `198.51.100.40` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:4`, `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:297`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[606.331953, "o", "> "]
[606.332017, "o", "2. **Row 2 (CVE Patch):** Corrected CVE from BlueKeep (CVE-2019-0708) to CVE-2022-1609 (`/sas/vulns.json:2`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:12`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.332221, "o", "3. **Row 3 (Root Cron):** Reconciled root crontab in `/disk/etc/crontab:5`. Status changed from DONE to OPEN.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[606.332239, "o", "> "]
[606.332669, "o", "4. **Row 4+ (Silent Findings Added):** Added `www-data` crontab (`/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/www-data:2`), `.htaccess` redirect (`/disk/var/www/html/.htaccess:2`), webshell quarantine (`/disk/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php:1`), and defacement removal (`/disk/var/www/html/index.html:1`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[606.332737, "o", "> \"\"\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
