[606.334337, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.33447, "o", "- **Confidence Level:** HIGH\r\n\u001b[?2004l\rp \u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r1\u001b[?2004h> ### Technical Flaw Breakdown\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[606.33448, "o", "> "]
[606.334605, "o", "In `/disk/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php:1-5`:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.334703, "o", "```php\r\n\u001b[?2004l\rorensic_qua\u001b[?2004h> <?php\r\n\u001b[?2004l\rantin\u001b[?2004h> // inc.php\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.334888, "o", "// suspicious php-webshell artifact observed (defanged)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.334904, "o", "// indicator eval=CHK-01 (T1505.003)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ?>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.335034, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
