[606.335134, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.335224, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### On-Disk Evidence of Exploitation\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[606.335308, "o", "> "]
[606.33539, "o", "1. **HTTP Exploitation Request:** `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:297`  \r\n\u001b[?2004l\rl\u001b[?2004h> "]
