[606.33727, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.337323, "o", "baseline = \"\"\"# Baseline & Configuration Security Weakness Report\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.337456, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\rw\u001b[?2004h> **Target Host:** wordpress-prod-01 (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:4`)  \r\n\u001b[?2004l\rle redirect of all traf\u001b[?2004h> "]
